                    <span id="alg2.l1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Inputs:</span> Same as <a href="#alg1" title="In Efficient implementation. ‣ 3.3 Algorithm ‣ 3 Lossless Vocabulary Reduction ‣ Lossless Vocabulary Reduction for Auto-Regressive Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Algorithm</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
