</span><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="alg2.l7.pic2" class="ltx_picture" height="1" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 1 1" width="1"><g transform="translate(0,1) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"></g></svg></span><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="alg2.l7.pic3" class="ltx_picture" height="1" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 1 1" width="1"><g transform="translate(0,1) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"></g></svg></span>
