<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Table 1: </span>Results of vocabulary reduction on GSM8K, with varying maximal token lengths from <math id="S5.T2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="S5.T2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>8</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">8</annotation></semantics></math> bytes. <span id="S5.T2.fig1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Full</span> refers to the original models, <span id="S5.T2.fig1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Naive</span> is the baseline of naive restriction and <span id="S5.T2.fig1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LVR</span> is our algorithm.</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
