</tbody>
</table>
</span></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>A cherry-picked example where we found the vocabulary-reduced models (of Falcon3-7B) do not agree with each other in the final answer. Among them, only the 2-bytes and 4-bytes models arrived at the correct answer, though the 2-bytes model made a spelling mistake soon after the answer. The 1-byte model made a calculation error in the middle, and the 8-byte model’s answer was wrong from the beginning. </figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
